        "turn": 0,
        "requestedRatio": 0.25,
        "native": "Ciao, eccoti qui. Another coffee break together. Bene. The Dead Branch had a drink—scuro e amaro. Five espresso shots out of five. Its name died with my old home. Nessuno ricorda. Not even me.",
        "translation": "Hello, there you are. Another coffee break together. Good. The Dead Branch had a drink—dark and bitter. Five espresso shots out of five. Its name died with my old home. Nobody remembers. Not even me.",
