          "translationShort": false,
          "canonical": 0
        },
        "durationMs": 11076
      },
      {
        "turn": 1,
        "requestedRatio": 0.3,
        "native": "Ho capito. That was… not mid. But entirely English. Two espresso shots for now. Puoi parlare in italiano? I have standards to hide behind.",
        "translation": "I understood. That was… not mid. But entirely English. Two espresso shots for now. Can you speak in Italian? I have standards to hide behind.",
